# The build context is the repo root (docker/compose.yaml `context: ..`). The
# Dockerfile copies named paths only, but the whole context is sent to the
# daemon first: a notebook in data/ (the owner's notes) and a local venv must
# never leave the machine that way. tests/test_docker_files.py checks this list.
.git
.venv
venv
data
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
node_modules
scratchpad
dist
build
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
